        "original_id": "1301984f-a9f5-58c4-bc35-f69ecf81b30b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Australian Women's Weekly, Godey's Lady's Book, Empire\n- People: Lyndey Milan\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group, Bauer Consumer Media\n- Places: Sydney, Philadelphia, Hamburg\n- Topics: women's magazines, film magazines\n\nFacts:\n- Godey's Lady's Book was a United States women's magazine published in Philadelphia from 1830 to 1878.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.\n- Lyndey Milan was the Food Director for The Australian Women's Weekly.\n- Lyndey Milan was a co-host on the Channel 9 show \"Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly\".\n- Empire is a British film magazine published monthly by Bauer Consumer Media of the Hamburg-based Bauer Media Group.",
